### 9. Assertion Roulette (Extended Catalog)
**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 69)

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);   // no message
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);       // no message
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);     // no message
```

3 assertions with no descriptive messages. A failure in CI reports only "expected 247.50 but got 200.00" with no context for which property failed.

**Fix:** Add message parameters:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(expectedSubtotal, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedTax, order.TaxAmount, "Tax mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedSubtotal + expectedTax, order.GrandTotal, "Grand total mismatch");
```

